<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Test document for the DRMD datamodel: a reference material certificate that uses every part of
  drmd.xsd v1.0.0 the datamodel holds, so that one round trip (XML -> objects -> XML) covers the
  whole mapping table in bam_masterdata/datamodel/drmd/README.md.

  It is valid against drmd.xsd and raises no assertion from drmd-business-rules.sch.
  The producer, the materials, the persons, the values and the embedded files are fictitious.

  Covered beyond the examples of the schema repository: two languages, timeAfterDispatch,
  postal address with coordinates, contact description data, persons with address and @refId,
  material classes, rich content with embedded files, si:realListXMLList, si:constant,
  coverage intervals, standard uncertainties, dcc:noQuantity, dcc:charsXMLList, used method
  quantities, complete measurement metadata, catch-all statements with heading, file and formula,
  drmd:comment and an embedded document.
-->
